  {
   "title": "Dialogue",
   "html": "<p class=\"muted\">Clara croise Noy devant chez elle, le matin.</p><div class=\"dialogue\"><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ສະບາຍດີ!</span><span class=\"rom\">Sā-bǎay-dǐi!</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ສະບາຍດີເຈົ້າ! ສະບາຍດີບໍ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Sā-bǎay-dǐi jâo! Sā-bǎay-dǐi bɔ̌ɔ?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ສະບາຍດີ ຂອບໃຈ ເຈົ້າເດ?</span><span class=\"rom\">Sā-bǎay-dǐi, khɔ̏ɔp-jǎy. Jâo dě?</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ສະບາຍດີຄືກັນ</span><span class=\"rom\">Sā-bǎay-dǐi khʉ́ʉ-kǎn.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ໂອ້ຍ! ຂໍໂທດ!</span><span class=\"rom\">Ôoy! Khɔ̌ɔ-thôot!</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ບໍ່ເປັນຫຍັງ</span><span class=\"rom\">Bɔ̀ɔ-pěn-nyǎng.</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ຄລາຣາ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ຂອບໃຈຫຼາຍໆ ໄປກ່ອນເດີ!</span><span class=\"rom\">Khɔ̏ɔp-jǎy lǎay-lǎay. Pǎy-kɔ̀ɔn dɤ̌ɤ!</span></div></div><div class=\"line\"><span class=\"who\">ນ້ອຍ</span><div><span class=\"lo\">ພົບກັນໃໝ່!</span><span class=\"rom\">Phōp-kǎn-mày!</span></div></div></div><details><summary>Traduction (seulement après avoir cherché)</summary><p><b>Clara</b> — Bonjour !<br><b>Noy</b> — Bonjour ! Ça va ?<br><b>Clara</b> — Ça va, merci. Et toi ?<br><b>Noy</b> — Ça va aussi.<br><b>Clara</b> — Oh ! Pardon !<br><b>Noy</b> — Pas grave.<br><b>Clara</b> — Merci beaucoup. J&#x27;y vais !<br><b>Noy</b> — À bientôt !</p></details>"
